      "claim": "The new macOS and Linux Maven installation steps present `tar xzvf` as the extraction command but omit the required archive operand and do not show how to extract into the named ~/tools directory. Running the displayed fragment exits 1 with \u201cOption f requires an argument\u201d, so a beginner following the newly added real-machine procedure cannot complete this step as written.",
