        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Give a complete command with the downloaded archive filename and destination, for example `tar -xzf ~/Downloads/apache-maven-<version>-bin.tar.gz -C ~/tools`, in both macOS and Linux steps; mirror it in artifact.md.",
